BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 780 Tm (RAGDoc: Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering over Scientific Documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (Abstract) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (We present RAGDoc, a retrieval-augmented architecture for question answering over scientific) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (documents. Existing systems either retrieve with sparse lexical matching, which fails on) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (paraphrase, or with dense embeddings, which blur rare identifiers. RAGDoc combines both and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (attributes every generated claim to a specific source passage. On our primary benchmark RAGDoc) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (reaches 84.2 F1, an improvement of 6.4 points over the strongest baseline. We release code and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (trained checkpoints. The remainder of this abstract sketches the shape of the contribution.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (Document question answering has matured rapidly, yet deployment in settings where correctness) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (is checked remains rare, and practitioners report that the gap is one of verification rather) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (than fluency. Our design begins from the assumption that a reader will want to confirm any) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (claim before relying on it, and that the cost of confirmation must therefore be close to zero.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (Every component described in the following sections is shaped by that requirement, including) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (the segmentation strategy, the retrieval stack, and the generation contract. We report results) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (on three public corpora and one internally constructed set, and we include an ablation that) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm (isolates the contribution of each retrieval component. We further discuss the conditions under) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm (which the system declines to answer, which we regard as a feature of the design rather than a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 476 Tm (shortcoming to be minimised. Reproduction instructions, evaluation scripts, and the exact) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 460 Tm (question sets used throughout are distributed alongside the implementation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 444 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 428 Tm (1) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
