BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 780 Tm (RAGDoc: Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering over Scientific Documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (1. Introduction) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (Researchers increasingly need to interrogate long technical documents rather than read them end) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (to end. The central obstacle is trust: a language model asked about a document will readily) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (produce a fluent answer that the document does not support. We argue that attribution, not) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (fluency, is the binding constraint on usefulness. A system that declines to answer is more) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (valuable than one that guesses, because a wrong answer with a confident tone costs the reader) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (more time than no answer at all. RAGDoc is built around that principle. The intuition is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (easiest to see from the reader's position. Presented with a paragraph of confident prose, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (reader has no way to separate the portion grounded in the source from the portion supplied by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (the model's own parameters. Verification then requires rereading the entire document, which is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (precisely the labour the system was meant to remove. The value of the tool collapses to zero,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (or below it, once the reader learns from experience that spot checks sometimes fail. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (therefore treat the unit of output not as a paragraph but as a claim paired with a pointer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (This reframing has consequences throughout the pipeline, and much of the engineering described) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm (later exists to keep that pointer trustworthy under conditions where it would otherwise) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm (degrade. The contributions of this work are an architecture that enforces the pairing, an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 476 Tm (evaluation methodology for measuring whether the pairing holds, and an empirical study of where) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 460 Tm (it breaks.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 444 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 428 Tm (2) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
