BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 780 Tm (RAGDoc: Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering over Scientific Documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (3. Method Overview) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (RAGDoc operates in three stages. First, a document is segmented into passages that never span a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (page boundary, so that every passage carries exactly one page number. Second, a hybrid) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (retriever scores passages against the query using both a lexical and a semantic ranker, and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (two ranked lists are merged. Third, a generator is conditioned on the merged passages and is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (instructed to cite the passages it used. The staging is deliberate. Each stage produces an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (artefact that can be inspected on its own, which matters because failures in this class of) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (system are otherwise difficult to localise. When an answer is wrong, the question of whether) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (the evidence was absent from the retrieved set or present but ignored has a definite answer,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (and that answer is recoverable without instrumenting the model itself. Stage boundaries are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (also where the guarantees live. The segmentation stage guarantees a property about page) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (attribution. The retrieval stage guarantees that scoring is reproducible given a fixed index.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (The generation stage guarantees that any emitted pointer refers to a passage that was genuinely) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (supplied. None of these guarantees depends on the behaviour of the language model, which is the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm (reason they hold under distribution shift and across model versions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 476 Tm (4) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
