BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 780 Tm (RAGDoc: Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering over Scientific Documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (4. Retrieval and Fusion) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (The lexical ranker uses Okapi BM25 over tokenised passage text. The semantic ranker embeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (passages with a sentence encoder producing 384-dimensional vectors and retrieves by cosine) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (similarity. The two lists are merged with Reciprocal Rank Fusion using a constant k of 60. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (adopt rank-based fusion because cosine similarity is bounded between zero and one while BM25) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (scores are unbounded, so combining the raw values would allow one ranker to dominate the other) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (arbitrarily. The two rankers fail in different directions, which is the condition under which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (combining them is worthwhile. Combining rankers that fail together yields the same errors at) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (greater expense. We verified the independence assumption by measuring the overlap between the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (two candidate sets and found it substantially below what correlated rankers would produce.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (Fusion operates on ordinal position alone and therefore discards magnitude information, which) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (is a genuine cost: a passage that one ranker considers overwhelmingly better than the next) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (receives no more credit than a passage that barely leads. We accept this because the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (alternative requires calibrating two scoring functions against each other, and that calibration) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm (proved unstable across documents of differing length in preliminary experiments.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 476 Tm (5) Tj ET
endstream
