BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 780 Tm (RAGDoc: Retrieval-Augmented Question Answering over Scientific Documents) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (5. Passage Segmentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (Passages are capped at 900 characters with an overlap of 150 characters between consecutive) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (passages. The overlap ensures that a sentence spanning a segmentation boundary still appears) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (intact in at least one passage. Segmentation is applied within a page rather than across the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (document, which costs a small amount of packing efficiency in exchange for unambiguous page) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (attribution. Boundaries are chosen by descending separator preference. Paragraph breaks are) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (preferred, then sentence terminators, then clause boundaries, and finally an arbitrary cut when) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (no better option exists within the budget. This ordering keeps semantically coherent units) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (intact where the text permits it. We examined finer and coarser settings. Shorter passages) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (sharpen retrieval precision but frequently sever the connection between a claim and the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (qualifying clause that constrains it, producing passages that are individually retrievable and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (jointly misleading. Longer passages preserve context at the cost of diluting the retrievable) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (signal, since a single relevant sentence is averaged against surrounding material during) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (encoding. The chosen configuration sits at the point where both effects were acceptable.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm (6) Tj ET
endstream
