BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (6. Training Setup) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (The generator is fine-tuned with the AdamW optimiser at a learning rate of 3e-4 for 40 epochs) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (with a batch size of 32. Training was performed on eight NVIDIA A100 GPUs and completed in) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (roughly 19 hours. We apply a linear warmup over the first 500 steps followed by cosine decay,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (and clip gradients at a norm of 1.0. Mixed precision training is used throughout. Supervision) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (pairs each question with a target response containing pointers to supporting passages.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (Distractor passages are included in every training instance so that the model cannot succeed by) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (attending indiscriminately to everything supplied. Roughly one instance in six is constructed) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (to be unanswerable from the accompanying passages, with the target response being a refusal;) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (without this proportion of negative examples the model learns that a plausible answer always) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (exists. Checkpoints were selected on a held-out split using a criterion that combined answer) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (quality with pointer correctness rather than answer quality alone. Selecting on answer quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (in isolation reliably produced checkpoints that scored well while attaching pointers) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (carelessly, which is the precise failure the architecture exists to prevent.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm (7) Tj ET
endstream
