BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (We evaluate on three question answering corpora. SQuAD provides extractive questions over) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (single passages. Natural Questions contains genuine search queries paired with long documents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (HotpotQA requires combining evidence from more than one passage to reach an answer. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (additionally construct an internal set of 1,200 questions written by domain experts over 40) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (machine learning papers. The internal set exists because the public corpora share a property) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (that flatters this class of system: their questions were written by annotators looking at the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (passage that answers them, which produces unusually high lexical overlap between question and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (evidence. Questions arising from genuine curiosity have no such guarantee, and the gap between) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (the two regimes is large enough to change conclusions. Annotators for the internal set were) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (instructed to write questions before locating the answer, and to include questions the document) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (does not address. The latter category comprises approximately one fifth of the set and exists) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (to measure whether the system declines when it should. Inter-annotator agreement on) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (answerability was substantial, and disagreements were adjudicated by a third annotator.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 492 Tm (8) Tj ET
