BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 764 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748 Tm (10. Limitations) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 732 Tm () Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 716 Tm (RAGDoc assumes that the source document yields clean extractable text. Scanned documents and) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700 Tm (pages where the content is presented as an image are not handled, since no optical character) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 684 Tm (recognition step is performed. Tables and mathematical notation are linearised into plain text,) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 668 Tm (which loses structure and occasionally corrupts the meaning of a numeric result. The system is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 652 Tm (monolingual and has only been evaluated on English text. Attribution is verified at the level) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636 Tm (of the passage rather than the sentence. A pointer therefore establishes that supporting) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 620 Tm (material occurs somewhere within a region of up to nine hundred characters, which is a weaker) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 604 Tm (guarantee than a reader might assume on first encountering the interface. Finally, the) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 588 Tm (evaluation measures faithfulness to retrieved passages and not truth. A document containing an) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 572 Tm (error will yield answers that faithfully reproduce that error, and the system will attach a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 556 Tm (pointer to it with full confidence. Nothing in this architecture detects a document that is) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 540 Tm (internally consistent and wrong, and we caution against interpreting an attributed answer as a) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 524 Tm (verified one.) Tj ET
BT /F1 11 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 508 Tm () Tj ET
